1a","title":"claude, make bun 10 MB smaller to compensate for adding 2 MB of libraries. don\u2019t make any mistakes.","url":"https://x.com/jarredsumner/status/2050526921037910382","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/claude-make-bun-10-mb-smaller-to-compensate-for-adding-2-mb-of-libraries-don-t-make-any-mistakes--ql6uyhf1a","summary":"A brief, humorous prompt directed at Claude asking it to reduce Bun's binary size by 10 MB to offset adding 2 MB of libraries, with the instruction to make no mistakes. This appears to be a real or satirical developer request related to Bun's bundle size optimization.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--OHB84bZF--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2010","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-02T10:44:49.000Z"},{"id":"MjIZ0VoXz","title":"claude, add an image processing library to bun. read github issues & CVEs from image processing libraries and write extensive adversarial tests. don\u2019t make any mistakes","url":"https://x.com/jarredsumner/status/2050504432081908210","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/claude-add-an-image-processing-library-to-bun-read-github-issues-cves-from-image-processing-libr-mjiz0voxz","summary":"A prompt/workflow demonstrating how to use Claude to add an image processing library to Bun by having it read GitHub issues and CVEs, then write extensive adversarial tests. Showcases AI-assisted development for security-conscious library integration.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--CxzD6vbw--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2005","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-02T09:15:27.000Z"},{"id":"2YWZeUk48","title":"so far, in the next version of Bun:\n- global bun install virtual store reduces disk usage\n- HTTP/3 Bun.serve() & fetch \n- HTTP/2 fetch\n- node:tls uses less ram\n- Stability fixes for Worker, MessagePort & BroadcastChannel\n\nguess the 2 things we\u2019ll add to this list before we ship","url":"https://x.c